<!doctype lake><title>Technical Report II</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><meta name="reading-minutes" content="30" /><h1 data-lake-id="vbvd6" id="vbvd6"><span data-lake-id="u4c45d09a" id="u4c45d09a">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u37987864" id="u37987864"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue5a03101" id="ue5a03101">𝐎𝐧 𝐭𝐡𝐞 𝐃𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐠𝐧 𝐨𝐟 𝐐𝐰𝐞𝐧𝟑.𝟖-𝐍𝐞𝐱𝐭 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞: 𝐄𝐯𝐚𝐥𝐮𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧, 𝐄𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜𝐢𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐲, 𝐚𝐧𝐝 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐢𝐧𝐢𝐧𝐠 𝐒𝐭𝐚𝐛𝐢𝐥𝐢𝐭𝐲</span></strong></h1><p data-lake-id="ued427808" id="ued427808"><strong><span data-lake-id="u72a80ba9" id="u72a80ba9">Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 是一个稀疏混合专家模型，总参数量为 125B，每个 token 激活 6B 参数，此外还包含存储于加速器之外、参数量为 51B 的 n-gram 嵌入表。其设计目标是以显著更低的计算预算，保持上一代旗舰模型 397B-A17B 的性能水平</span></strong></p><ul list="u6f6cc04c"><li fid="u9727e872" data-lake-id="u10b8b3d1" id="u10b8b3d1"><span data-lake-id="ub45612fc" id="ub45612fc">token 混合采用 Gated DeltaNet 与全局注意力按层交替的混合架构：循环层以线性计算成本将前缀压缩为固定大小的状态，同时每四层设置一个全注意力层，以保留有限状态记忆无法精确复现的 token 级直接检索能力</span></li><li fid="u9727e872" data-lake-id="ub61912a8" id="ub61912a8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u04d3b521" id="u04d3b521" style="color: #5C0036">在继续预训练阶段，这些全注意力层被替换为 Qwen Sparse Attention（QSA）。QSA 延续稀疏注意力技术路线，但采用基于压缩的轻量级索引器，以微块为粒度对上下文进行评分，从而降低长序列下索引过程本身的开销</span></strong></li><li fid="u9727e872" data-lake-id="u42595d36" id="u42595d36"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc89a20ea" id="uc89a20ea" style="color: #5C0036">残差流被拓宽为四个分支，并通过逐元素门控进行读取；将这一设计称为门控残差。拓宽残差流增加残差路径的容量，门控则决定如何使用这些容量，同时提供维持训练稳定性所需的重缩放</span></strong></li><li fid="u9727e872" data-lake-id="ue3a9661d" id="ue3a9661d"><span data-lake-id="ucedb9c33" id="ucedb9c33">单个 n-gram 嵌入层在主干网络外扩展容量，通过从主机内存预取嵌入表扩大参数规模，每个 token 新增的浮点运算量与延迟可忽略</span></li></ul><figure class="lake-figure" id="qwen38-flash-next-architecture" style="width:640px"><a href="assets/fb0bdf105c4ca49a5cc6a2033c01cdb8.png"><img src="assets/fb0bdf105c4ca49a5cc6a2033c01cdb8.png" alt="Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 模型架构" width="2885" height="2930" decoding="async"></a></figure><p data-lake-id="ue3ba2960" id="ue3ba2960"><strong><span data-lake-id="uff37832c" id="uff37832c">损失与下游准确率的变化并不总是一致，观察到两个方向上的不一致现象</span></strong></p><ul list="uac833276"><li fid="u0e485061" data-lake-id="ua1a7f6ed" id="ua1a7f6ed"><span data-lake-id="u4cd363f6" id="u4cd363f6">扩大 n-gram 词表规模会使损失单调下降，而下游准确率则趋于饱和；在固定参数预算下，损失最优配置与准确率最优配置也并不一致。相反，根据残差状态预测残差的读取与写入权重，仅带来较小的损失下降，却能明显改善基准表现</span></li><li fid="u0e485061" data-lake-id="udc909f9c" id="udc909f9c"><span data-lake-id="u56cd0a94" id="u56cd0a94">将每个块限制为仅使用门控值最高的两个残差分支，几乎不会影响预训练损失，但随着训练进一步推进，性能会出现退化；</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5cb0efbd" id="u5cb0efbd" style="color: #5C0036">从全注意力层中移除位置编码，在预训练阶段未表现出可辨别的差异，却会影响后续阶段的生成质量</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="udb0e9522" id="udb0e9522"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2e7262c0" id="u2e7262c0">分别评估训练、预填充和解码阶段的成本</span></strong></p><ul list="ub7f09343"><li fid="u04ec3ded" data-lake-id="ub200f591" id="ub200f591"><span data-lake-id="u981fce70" id="u981fce70">在训练阶段，相较于 GPU 上的 Triton 基线实现，FlashQLA 的前向计算加速比达到 2–3 倍，反向计算加速比约为 2 倍</span></li><li fid="u04ec3ded" data-lake-id="u9bdef444" id="u9bdef444"><span data-lake-id="u949cb983" id="u949cb983">Muon 也引入相应的工程开销：其单位参数浮点运算量取决于矩阵形状，而非参数总量，因此需要依据估计的正交化成本，重新划分数据并行梯度缓冲区；此外，融合参数被拆分后，优化器更新步骤会分散为大量小型计算核，因此使用 CUDA Graph 捕获该更新步骤。将 Newton–Schulz 迭代次数设为 8，以优先获得压力条件下更高的稳定性</span></li><li fid="u04ec3ded" data-lake-id="uf5122c32" id="uf5122c32"><span data-lake-id="uf807a14d" id="uf807a14d">推理时，预填充的主要开销来自全上下文注意力计算。QSA 将键序列长度压缩至原来的<span class="lake-math-punctuation"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-uf807a14d-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221%2Fr%22%7D"></card>，</span>使索引器的计算开销从<card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-uf807a14d-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22O(n%5E2)%22%7D"></card></span><span data-lake-id="u5ba70600" id="u5ba70600">降至<span class="lake-math-punctuation"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-u5ba70600-1%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22O(n%5E2%2Fr)%22%7D"></card>。</span>解码阶段的主要开销则来自内存数据传输，因此 GDN 层采用固定大小的循环状态，GR 移除分支混合算子<span class="lake-math-punctuation"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22text-u5ba70600-2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22H_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%7D"></card>，</span>残差状态也支持以 FP8 格式存储。在 1M 上下文的计算核测试中，QSA 相较于稠密注意力的预填充和解码加速比分别为 7.6 倍和 4.9 倍</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6445e2e6" id="u6445e2e6"><strong><span data-lake-id="ube267146" id="ube267146">Muon 用于线性映射的二维权重矩阵；输入嵌入、n-gram 嵌入、输出头、MoE 路由器及 GR 的低秩投影仍使用 AdamW，因为对这些参数进行正交化不切实际或无法带来收益。正交化前需拆分融合参数，避免直接处理拼接矩阵时混合无关子块的奇异方向</span></strong></p><ul list="u22234f4d"><li fid="u7bd32824" data-lake-id="u069d1cc3" id="u069d1cc3"><span data-lake-id="u5be9d35e" id="u5be9d35e">新的架构与优化器也改变最优超参数，因此重新拟合 Qwen3.5 系列所使用的缩放定律。新的缩放定律预测，更大的批量大小和学习率更为合适。更大的批量大小提高大规模训练中的并行吞吐量，更大的学习率则改善收敛表现。</span><span fid="u7bd32824" data-lake-id="u5bb5128a" id="u5bb5128a"><span data-lake-id="ubab7442f" id="ubab7442f">在训练初期逐步增大批量大小，最终效果并不优于从训练开始就采用目标批量大小，同时还会增加 18.8% 的优化器更新步数，因此未采用这一策略</span></span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc51bd82d" id="uc51bd82d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u705df182" id="u705df182">通过压力测试验证训练稳定性：提高学习率，并在训练过程中保持学习率恒定，以便在中等模型规模下复现大规模训练中的不稳定现象</span></strong></p><ul list="uf1a65f03"><li fid="u23e8b6bd" data-lake-id="ua8aafa0e" id="ua8aafa0e"><span data-lake-id="ub4a4aa24" id="ub4a4aa24">评判标准是：在相同压力条件下，新训练方案的稳定性至少应达到其所替代的上一代方案的水平。当学习率设为最优值的四倍时，前代架构频繁出现损失尖峰，而新方案在整个训练过程中均保持稳定</span></li><li fid="u23e8b6bd" data-lake-id="u198bc3b8" id="u198bc3b8"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf629ba4d" id="uf629ba4d" style="color: #5C0036">仅以 GR 中的门控为变量进行的成对对照实验进一步证实，该门控是新方案相较于 Qwen3.5 架构获得更大稳定裕度的关键因素之一</span></strong></li><li id="u8f82a94c"><span>上述改进使 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 全规模训练未见损失尖峰或梯度范数异常波动，也未用 qk-clip 或 SwiGLU-clip 等显式裁剪</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="I0g4j" id="I0g4j"><span data-lake-id="uba1ab329" id="uba1ab329">🍄 𝐆𝐃𝐍 𝐇𝐲𝐛𝐫𝐢𝐝 𝐀𝐫𝐜𝐡𝐢𝐭𝐞𝐜𝐭𝐮𝐫𝐞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u25f14c11" id="u25f14c11"><strong><span data-lake-id="uaea6e26e" id="uaea6e26e">全自注意力能够基于内容直接访问每一个先前 token，但其 token 混合的计算成本随序列长度呈二次增长，键值缓存则在自回归生成过程中线性增长。滑动窗口注意力以有界的局部感受野替代全局访问，从而降低计算成本和缓存占用。然而，窗口之外的信息只能通过跨层传播间接传递，由此形成高效局部处理与持久的内容相关记忆之间的矛盾</span></strong></p><ul list="u120454de"><li fid="uee3ffec8" data-lake-id="u263e837b" id="u263e837b"><span data-lake-id="u31bd895e" id="u31bd895e">为缓解这一矛盾，采用 Gated DeltaNet 与全局注意力按层混合的架构。GDN 将前缀压缩为固定大小的循环状态，并根据当前内容更新该状态；交错设置的全局注意力层则保留 token 级直接检索能力，而这种能力难以由有限状态的循环记忆精确复现</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc9adaa40" id="uc9adaa40"><strong><span data-lake-id="u55ef5a5c" id="u55ef5a5c">门控 Delta 递推：线性注意力可视为一种快权重记忆，通过矩阵状态存储键值关联。对于每个注意力头，设</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SPOCl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%2C%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%7D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ubb789627" id="ubb789627">，</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aoCyQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_v%7D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u7a603342" id="u7a603342">。按照实现中的约定，GDN 维护状态</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22sAePD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd_k%5C%5Ctimes%20d_v%7D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u33f41fcb" id="u33f41fcb">，这一状态表示与原始公式采用的表示互为转置，并按照以下门控 Delta 规则更新</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ubb2a43f4" id="ubb2a43f4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Mhd3g%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%3D%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t-%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cwidetilde%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%2B%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D_t%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B1%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7873f606"><li fid="uee9eda68" data-lake-id="ua43c4b23" id="ua43c4b23"><span data-lake-id="u3956eb0d" id="u3956eb0d">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LURjT%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5402203" id="ud5402203">是数据依赖的衰减系数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tLovz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cin(0%2C1)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7f94c58a" id="u7f94c58a">控制 Delta 更新。上述递推等价于</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uac3172d9" id="uac3172d9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ErIwY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_t%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%5Cn-%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BS%7D_%7Bt-1%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cbeta_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B2%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u4e949d9c"><li fid="uf66ecf38" data-lake-id="u16a9124a" id="u16a9124a"><span data-lake-id="u70fb67a8" id="u70fb67a8"></span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud1cfef2d" id="ud1cfef2d" style="color: #5C0036">衰减系数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jNL6P%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha_t%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud838cc3f" id="ud838cc3f" style="color: #5C0036">从全局上控制已有状态的保留时间；Delta 项则先估计当前状态中已与</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yQSA8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%22%7D" style="color: #5C0036"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6aa72a5a" id="u6aa72a5a" style="color: #5C0036">关联的值，再仅写入相应残差。因此，重复或相似的键会更新已有的关联，而非无界地累加外积</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2d34de0f" id="u2d34de0f">。这种有针对性的擦除与写入操作，使 GDN 区别于纯加法形式的线性注意力</span></li></ul><figure data-lake-id="u6af9c537" id="u6af9c537" class="lake-figure" style="width:547px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A547%2C%22height%22%3A358%2C%22originWidth%22%3A946%2C%22originHeight%22%3A620%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C0.8214%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u014f0198%22%7D" data-asset="assets/bc21e7417f863f308c735b3726235db6.png"></card></figure><p data-lake-id="ue93c3701" id="ue93c3701"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8ec27f1f" id="u8ec27f1f">GDN 的参数化：给定归一化后的残差流输入</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22yTpLr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a85fe8b" id="u6a85fe8b">，GDN 先进行可学习的投影，再应用短核逐通道因果卷积，以计算内容特征</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u30b5d8b7" id="u30b5d8b7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LSpW5%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BL2Norm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_q%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B3%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u719d4994" id="u719d4994" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XDhe9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BL2Norm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_k%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u35a64546" id="u35a64546" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cXS32%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bv%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BShortConv%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_v%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u6ca69ec2"><li fid="udc56b3aa" data-lake-id="u5e4449eb" id="u5e4449eb"><span data-lake-id="u6fff3081" id="u6fff3081">短核卷积在信息压入循环状态前引入局部归纳偏置。L2 归一化约束查询和键的幅值，稳定秩一 Delta 状态转移。写入强度与衰减系数为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ubcd2721a" id="ubcd2721a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22npOPZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbeta_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Csigma%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cbeta%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Calpha_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cexp%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn-%5C%5Cexp%28A%29%5C%5C%2C%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsoftplus%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%2Bb_%7B%5C%5Calpha%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue8a3e230"><li fid="u10f105ec" data-lake-id="uc1d65b24" id="uc1d65b24"><span data-lake-id="u03753a13" id="u03753a13">在各注意力头上独立执行递推后，对各头的输出进行归一化，并通过依赖输入的输出门控加以调制</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u36eb6e6a" id="u36eb6e6a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hOXeB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bo%7D_t%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_o%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cn%5C%5Csigma%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_z%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D_t%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u34cab20e"><li fid="u78bb9fd7" data-lake-id="u4c402f01" id="u4c402f01"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub3b489d7" id="ub3b489d7" style="color: #270070">原始 GDN 采用 SiLU 输出门控，作者采用有界 sigmoid 门控。沿用 Qwen3-Next 的设计，采用零中心 RMSNorm，以约束 RMSNorm 权重的增长。模型中的其余所有 RMSNorm 层也统一采用这一形式</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u34dd4464" id="u34dd4464"><span data-lake-id="uaded0f13" id="uaded0f13">在模型层面，该混合架构在全注意力层中保留旋转位置嵌入。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe94eb17" id="ufe94eb17" style="color: #270070">采用 RoPE 的模型与不使用位置编码的 NoPE 变体，在预训练阶段表现差异较小；但在完成后训练后，NoPE 变体出现无休止生成的比例显著更高，因而更容易发生生成无法终止的问题</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufbc03bc1" id="ufbc03bc1">。在每四层中设置一个全注意力层，其余三层采用 GDN。这一层间配置在效率与质量之间取得较好的平衡，其中，周期性设置的全注意力层对长上下文性能尤为重要</span></p><p data-lake-id="u17a5e420" id="u17a5e420"><span data-lake-id="u7969666c" id="u7969666c">为提高效率，使用 FlashQLA 优化 GDN 计算核。FlashQLA 是一个基于 TileLang 的融合线性注意力计算核库。在 NVIDIA GPU 上的多种配置下，相较于 FLA 的 Triton 计算核，FlashQLA 的前向计算加速比达到 2–3 倍，反向计算加速比约为 2 倍</span></p><figure data-lake-id="ua699d9e1" id="ua699d9e1" class="lake-figure" style="width:931.2px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A931.2%2C%22height%22%3A141.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1164%2C%22originHeight%22%3A176%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u3372e982%22%7D" data-asset="assets/8ebf5a95ebdcb678e3d9eb7be648dfab.png"></card></figure><h2 data-lake-id="I0g4j" id="qsa-section"><span data-lake-id="uba1ab329" id="qsa-section-title">🌊</span><span data-lake-id="uf35b95fc" id="uf35b95fc"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u00d313e1" id="u00d313e1">𝐐𝐰𝐞𝐧 𝐒𝐩𝐚𝐫𝐬𝐞 𝐀𝐭𝐭𝐞𝐧𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></strong></h2><p data-lake-id="u403e3b05" id="u403e3b05"><strong><span data-lake-id="ubae6ae02" id="ubae6ae02">稀疏注意力通过选择性地关注重要上下文，缓解长上下文场景中 softmax 注意力的二次计算复杂度瓶颈。近期，DSA 利用轻量级索引器生成 token 级稀疏掩码，实现显著的推理加速。然而，随着序列长度增加，其复杂度为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WzZvP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22O(n%5E2)%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u87d38b09" id="u87d38b09">的索引器仍会带来不可忽略的开销</span></strong></p><ul list="udfc58f88"><li fid="u532e7a6b" data-lake-id="u97bcb91e" id="u97bcb91e"><span data-lake-id="u2d27c2c3" id="u2d27c2c3">为降低这一索引成本，Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 采用 Qwen 稀疏注意力。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u010d3214" id="u010d3214" style="color: #DF2A3F">具体而言，QSA 使用轻量级索引器，将序列压缩为微块表示，估计各微块的重要性，并选择最相关的上下文参与注意力计算。这一设计降低长输入下的索引开销，同时兼顾任务表现与推理效率。相较于跨层共享索引的方法，QSA 在层内进行序列压缩，对跨层相似性的依赖较低，因此天然适用于混合架构</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4949c012" id="u4949c012"></span></li></ul><figure data-lake-id="uce8fa9d3" id="uce8fa9d3" class="lake-figure" style="width:722.7999877929688px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A722.7999877929688%2C%22height%22%3A375.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1156%2C%22originHeight%22%3A599%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u6df4c96f%22%7D" data-asset="assets/548611fbcaaf84c0609c984c88d2082b.png"></card></figure><p data-lake-id="u52c9e1ca" id="u52c9e1ca"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub4e3f797" id="ub4e3f797">压缩式轻量级索引器：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua3cbea32" id="ua3cbea32">给定输入隐状态</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22iCKS2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufa6dd749" id="ufa6dd749">，索引器采用包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xeoOG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22H%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uef419d85" id="uef419d85">个查询头和一个共享键头的多查询注意力。首先，分别执行独立的轻量级投影</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf3b40414" id="uf3b40414" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22X4MQD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D_i%5E%7Bh%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_Q%5E%7Bh%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_i%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_K%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B8%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uab3677c5"><li fid="u27256e1c" data-lake-id="u071a2bb1" id="u071a2bb1"><span data-lake-id="u5fca68a2" id="u5fca68a2">将键序列划分为互不重叠的块，每块包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jMbpb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2efc66a4" id="u2efc66a4">个 token，经平均池化压缩。第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DR2Lq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4976a1b8" id="u4976a1b8">个块的起始位置为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eX77R%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_b%3Db%5C%5Ccdot%20r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u845773bb" id="u845773bb">，压缩键为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4aaa0c3f" id="u4aaa0c3f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22U1j1Z%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D_b%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BAvgPool%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D_%7Bp_b%3Ap_b%2Br-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn0%5C%5Cleq%20b%3C%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clfloor%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bn%7D%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crfloor%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B9%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u91287038"><li fid="ua34f7d6d" data-lake-id="ud82999aa" id="ud82999aa"><span data-lake-id="u6a2637f7" id="u6a2637f7">在位置编码方面，索引器采用部分旋转位置嵌入。具体而言，在索引器每个头的 128 个维度中，仅对其中 64 个维度应用 RoPE，其旋转维度与核心注意力模块保持一致。键压缩先于位置编码执行。因此，每个块先被汇总为一个内容表示，再被赋予一个块级位置。这一顺序避免对具有不同旋转相位的 token 表示进行平均。每个查询保留自身的 token 位置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SMqVE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9520f5ca" id="u9520f5ca">，每个压缩键则使用所属块的起始位置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xWbBb%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22p_b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue0ca769a" id="ue0ca769a"></span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uea22fbf4" id="uea22fbf4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aYQXo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_i%5E%7Bh%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPRoPE%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D%7D_i%5E%7Bh%7D%2Ci%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D_b%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BPRoPE%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D_b%2Cp_b%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B10%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua4852122"><li fid="u03546ee8" data-lake-id="u07e4052a" id="u07e4052a"><span data-lake-id="u99d6ae39" id="u99d6ae39">在块级因果约束下计算重要性分数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22qdpsH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uebe359e2" id="uebe359e2">。对于查询 token</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cowjZ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0abcc71d" id="u0abcc71d">和压缩块</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SMHK9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u825f8a64" id="u825f8a64">，对查询与键的相似度应用 ReLU，再对各索引器头求和</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u2f8adedc" id="u2f8adedc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zPbBM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22I_%7Bib%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bh%3D1%7D%5E%7BH%7D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BReLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clangle%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bq%7D_i%5E%7Bh%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bk%7D%7D_b%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crangle%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%2C%5Cn%26%5Cnp_b%2Br-1%5C%5Cleq%20i%2C%5Cn%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B6pt%5D%5Cn-%5C%5Cinfty%2C%5Cn%26%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B11%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u44dfb4e3"><li fid="u7db4cfb2" data-lake-id="u1fc12a13" id="u1fc12a13"><span data-lake-id="u12609549" id="u12609549">这一块级因果条件确保每个查询仅对已经完整观测到的块进行评分。给定 token 预算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ARYX8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22K%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u25d97026" id="u25d97026">，每个查询选择得分最高的压缩块。由于每个块包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22GcmBO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub7ddc0fb" id="ub7ddc0fb">个 token，块数量预算为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LI6a0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22K_B%3D%5C%5Clceil%20K%2Fr%5C%5Crceil%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u99ba04cf" id="u99ba04cf"></span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u228b9a7f" id="u228b9a7f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22akor8%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BTopK%7D_%7BK_B%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5C%7BI_%7Bib%7D%5C%5C%7D_b%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5CnK_B%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clceil%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7BK%7D%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crceil%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B12%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u0b68a4f1"><li fid="uc48a4c9c" data-lake-id="u2d8d19b4" id="u2d8d19b4"><span data-lake-id="u404ab8f3" id="u404ab8f3">随后，将选中的块展开为原始 token 索引，并截断至预算</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22d0NcP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22K%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6f68679" id="ud6f68679">。这些 token 与末尾不完整块中的 token 共同构成核心注意力计算使用的最终集合；其中，末尾不完整块中的 token 始终被纳入</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uab430b66" id="uab430b66"><strong><span data-lake-id="u20e4c52a" id="u20e4c52a" style="color: #5C0036">QSA 在 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 的继续预训练阶段引入，训练序列长度为 256K 个 token。训练过程包括稠密蒸馏和稀疏训练两个阶段</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ud2113ddb" id="ud2113ddb"><strong><span data-lake-id="uece29394" id="uece29394">阶段一：稠密蒸馏。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u703cd6b5" id="u703cd6b5">首先，将主干网络在完整序列上的注意力分布蒸馏至索引器。token 级教师分布由所有教师注意力头的 softmax 注意力分布求和，再经</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22FIYMd%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22L_1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5c240cf6" id="u5c240cf6">归一化得到。记由此得到的查询</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22dezYu%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94498c7b" id="u94498c7b">指向 token</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22JM5ag%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u800bda50" id="u800bda50">的概率为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UxzXu%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22a_%7Bij%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7a2acf00" id="u7a2acf00">，完整的 token 级分布为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zbdVG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u67acccaa" id="u67acccaa">。通过最大池化，将这一分布与块级索引器分数对齐，以保留可能在聚合过程中被稀释的重要 token 级信号</span></p><p data-lake-id="ua203a4e9" id="ua203a4e9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OWk50%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7Ba%7D_%7Bib%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BMaxPool%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D_%7Bi%2Cp_b%3Ap_b%2Br-1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_i%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_i%5Cn%7D%7B%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7C%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7C_1%5Cn%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B13%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7ec6d325"><li fid="u2e2d7184" data-lake-id="u77c09684" id="u77c09684"><span data-lake-id="u5fcc1705" id="u5fcc1705">令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rqy5h%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22B%3D%5C%5Clfloor%20n%2Fr%5C%5Crfloor%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6294bf1c" id="u6294bf1c">，池化后的教师分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22R8RTl%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u79ff5156" id="u79ff5156">与索引器分数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RM2k3%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7BB%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u17d07b83" id="u17d07b83">具有相同块维度。最小化下式，将归一化教师分数蒸馏至索引器</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6ddfc00f" id="u6ddfc00f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IcSvP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BN%7D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_i%5CnD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_%7Bi%2C%3A%7D%5Cn%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%3B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D_%7Bi%2C%3A%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue4e0ca6c"><li fid="ucf4eb132" data-lake-id="u2cbfd62b" id="u2cbfd62b"><span data-lake-id="u7a6e6343" id="u7a6e6343">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22LxYZQ%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22N%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u47e7c88c" id="u47e7c88c">为查询 token 的数量。计算每个查询的 KL 损失时，仅纳入完整的键块。在预热阶段，仅训练索引器，共训练 1000 步，学习率为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SFKX2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221%5C%5Ctimes10%5E%7B-3%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua560ea35" id="ua560ea35">。每步包含 8 条长度为 256K 个 token 的序列，训练 token 总量约为 2B</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u58e29ed6" id="u58e29ed6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u571961e4" id="u571961e4">阶段二：稀疏训练。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub119ef41" id="ub119ef41">完成索引器初始化后，在索引器的引导下训练整个主干网络，使其适应稀疏注意力模式。QSA 首先选择得分最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tm1VD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22K_B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3417d459" id="u3417d459">个块，将这些块展开为 token 索引，并与末尾不完整块中的尾部 token 合并</span></p><p data-lake-id="u9bd656dc" id="u9bd656dc" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nYiXY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BS%7D_i%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BExpand%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ccup%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5C%7B%5Cnr%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5C%5Clfloor%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7Bi%2B1%7D%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5Crfloor%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cldots%2C%5Cni%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5C%5C%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B15%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u595df3c2"><li fid="u80d28d1c" data-lake-id="ud57cbbe8" id="ud57cbbe8"><span data-lake-id="u08f9e86d" id="u08f9e86d">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VqhHO%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BExpand%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u33824910" id="u33824910">算子将选中的块映射为其对应的 token 索引，所得集合</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22x5SpN%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BS%7D_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1ef1ef41" id="u1ef1ef41">用于核心注意力计算。在这一阶段，索引器的 KL 损失仅在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22I0v3D%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u85a84cad" id="u85a84cad">中得分最高的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22UfXNV%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22K_B%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u352f4862" id="u352f4862">个块上计算。在计算 KL 散度之前，将教师分布在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NOYrF%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u079b5705" id="u079b5705">内的概率重新归一化，使其总和为 1</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4542795f" id="u4542795f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DPc9k%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BL%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BN%7D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_i%5CnD_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BKL%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7Ba%7D%7D_%7Bi%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%7D%5Cn%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Cmiddle%5C%5C%7C%5C%5C%3B%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSoftmax%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D_%7Bi%2C%5C%5Cmathcal%7BB%7D_i%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B16%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7b577c0b"><li fid="uaae4a9cc" data-lake-id="u000b89df" id="u000b89df"><span data-lake-id="u3d0ae38b" id="u3d0ae38b">在 CPT 的最后阶段，启用 QSA，并以</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22z6mT7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%222.5%5C%5Ctimes10%5E%7B-5%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u53007284" id="u53007284">的学习率联合训练主干网络与索引器，共训练 8000 步。每步包含 96 条长度为 256K 个 token 的序列，训练 token 总量约为 200B</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6d4214be" id="u6d4214be"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6929c8d7" id="u6929c8d7">在 Qwen3.8-Flash-Next 中，主干网络和 MTP 模块内的所有全注意力层均被替换为 QSA，以提高长序列推理效率。压缩式轻量级索引器采用包含四个查询头和一个共享键头的 MQA 结构，并使用前述 partial RoPE 配置</span></strong></p><ul list="u1ff0b790"><li fid="uc0f9b4ad" data-lake-id="ua1f97fb7" id="ua1f97fb7"><span data-lake-id="u187dbb9d" id="u187dbb9d">当 token 预算为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22hMwQY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22K%3D2048%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u10faa28e" id="u10faa28e">、压缩比为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bYuLH%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r%3D4%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0e234bcc" id="u0e234bcc">时，QSA 为每个查询最多选择 512 个完整块，并额外纳入末尾不完整块中的尾部 token。索引器对重要性的准确估计，使模型在第二阶段的稀疏训练中能够紧密跟随全注意力模型的语言模型损失变化轨迹</span></li><li fid="uc0f9b4ad" data-lake-id="uda8691a5" id="uda8691a5"><span data-lake-id="u489678ec" id="u489678ec">融合式 QSA 计算核联合计算稀疏注意力输出与 KL 损失，无需显式存储中间结果，从而降低内存占用并提高训练效率。压缩索引器在压缩后的序列上进行评分，同时减少索引器计算与 top-k </span><span data-lake-id="u2837bcdc" id="u2837bcdc">选择的开销。多步 MTP 在预测步骤间复用 top-k </span><span data-lake-id="u7122635d" id="u7122635d">索引，降低草稿模型推理成本</span></li></ul><figure data-lake-id="uf187570d" id="uf187570d" class="lake-figure" style="width:885.6000366210938px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A885.6000366210938%2C%22height%22%3A123.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1157%2C%22originHeight%22%3A161%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u2221532a%22%7D" data-asset="assets/77ccb1e2688f572542659b3dd8ec76aa.png"></card></figure><p data-lake-id="ubc436707" id="ubc436707"><strong><span data-lake-id="u196f3ef5" id="u196f3ef5">性能评估：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u00c029b7" id="u00c029b7">QSA 在 8 项通用基准中的 7 项上达到或超过全注意力基线，平均得分由 75.9 提升至 76.8。其长上下文检索优势在较长序列上更为明显：超过 512K 时，RULER 得分由 90.08 提升至 93.00；在 512K 和 1M 长度下，MRCR 得分分别由 30.66、20.71 提升至 40.53、26.44。此外，在四步投机解码中，跨步骤复用 QSA 索引后，MTP 的平均接受长度未出现显著变化</span></p><p data-lake-id="uf4158923" id="uf4158923"><strong><span data-lake-id="u76ac38f7" id="u76ac38f7">效率与加速：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1d716cf9" id="u1d716cf9">QSA 通过将键序列压缩至原长度的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22VlwWm%22%2C%22code%22%3A%221%2Fr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucf601c65" id="ucf601c65">，将索引器复杂度由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Xa9Jj%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22O(n%5E2)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u02028699" id="u02028699">降至</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KWyTA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22O(n%5E2%2Fr)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf640aab1" id="uf640aab1">，同时减少 MQA logits 计算与 top-k </span><span data-lake-id="u127dc749" id="u127dc749">选择的开销。在同时计入索引器和稀疏核心注意力计算的计算核测试中，相较于 FlashInfer 的分页 GQA 基线，QSA 在 1M 上下文长度下的预填充与解码注意力模块加速比分别达到 7.6 倍和 4.9 倍</span></p><p data-lake-id="u5daa8127" id="u5daa8127"><strong><span data-lake-id="u11ba0dcb" id="u11ba0dcb">架构消融：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7b9ee8e4" id="u7b9ee8e4">35B-A3B 实验表明，QSA 在相对索引延迟降至 0.25 时即可达到全注意力基线的性能，而跨层共享索引的 IndexShare 在相对延迟为 0.5 时仍低于基线，支持混合架构中采用层内压缩的设计。训练方面：稠密蒸馏后直接启用稀疏注意力会导致性能下降，经过短期联合训练后则可恢复至全注意力水平。查询头消融表明，少量索引器查询头即可维持性能；综合推理速度与准确率，最终采用四个查询头</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="Vz9oD" id="Vz9oD"><span data-lake-id="ud81f51c0" id="ud81f51c0">🌿</span><span data-lake-id="u09e6c769" id="u09e6c769"> 𝐆𝐚𝐭𝐞𝐝 𝐑𝐞𝐬𝐢𝐝𝐮𝐚𝐥</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u0bb9196d" id="u0bb9196d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8fa5f17e" id="u8fa5f17e">残差连接为每个块提供通向网络输出的直接路径。预归一化能够维持大规模训练的稳定性，但也会削弱各层接收到的信号：所有块读取同一条残差流，因此，较早写入的特征必须与后续写入的全部信息竞争。已有研究通过增加额外路径缓解这一瓶颈，包括稠密的层间连接、针对注意力值向量的额外残差路径，以及缓存状态的跨层复用。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u13fb92ca" id="u13fb92ca">直接修改残差路径的方法主要分为两类</span></p><ul list="ub83f442c"><li fid="u9eacabf8" data-lake-id="ud1ff4129" id="ud1ff4129"><span data-lake-id="u93d2610e" id="u93d2610e">第一类沿用 Highway Networks 的思路，增强各层读取与写入操作的表达能力</span></li><li fid="u9eacabf8" data-lake-id="u52c0b206" id="u52c0b206"><span data-lake-id="u5bfb98ba" id="u5bfb98ba">第二类则拓宽残差流本身：Alternating Updates（AltUp）和 Hyper-Connections（HC）以多个并行分支替代单一残差向量。这两类方法具有互补性：拓宽残差流增加容量，更丰富的读写机制则决定如何利用这些容量</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u1ec6b833" id="u1ec6b833"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4f852f8d" id="u4f852f8d">拓宽残差流：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5e08d412" id="u5e08d412">采用适用于预归一化网络的简化 AltUp 变体，考察仅拓宽残差流的收益。第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22lODMS%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cell%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf0e50407" id="uf0e50407">个块之前的残差状态由</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22i6RtS%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n_r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4bf4fea4" id="u4bf4fea4">个分支构成，记为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gIemG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_r%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u76730e76" id="u76730e76">，其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wsKBs%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22d%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3699be4e" id="u3699be4e">为隐藏维度，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22XpShh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8fe01732" id="u8fe01732">表示第</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CNcfn%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22i%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6db1fca2" id="u6db1fca2">个分支。每个块包含</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SXHIc%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n_r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u54dc5e71" id="u54dc5e71">个可学习标量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IlOTY%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bh%7D%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_r%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u73decd4e" id="u73decd4e">，通过各分支的加权和读取输入</span></p><p data-lake-id="udb8b04d6" id="udb8b04d6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Inp0o%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%29%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bn_r%7D%5Cnh_i%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%29%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B17%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u1a2c920f"><li fid="uda6aa3aa" data-lake-id="u00b7593c" id="u00b7593c"><span data-lake-id="u811bc96b" id="u811bc96b">随后，将块输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fxVyB%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud6353120" id="ud6353120">写回单个分支，写入分支按照网络深度循环选择</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u35b7c4ef" id="u35b7c4ef" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22B4A2Z%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%2B1%29%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%29%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%5B%5Cni%3D%5C%5Cell%5C%5Cbmod%20n_r%5Cn%5C%5Cright%5D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%29%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B18%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uf5ab60ea"><li fid="ubb9644b5" data-lake-id="u8de2bfa8" id="u8de2bfa8"><span data-lake-id="ue02ef3e6" id="ue02ef3e6">这一设计仅为每个块增加</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22f46am%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n_r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u572e3960" id="u572e3960">个参数，不引入矩阵乘法，因此计算成本可以忽略；额外开销主要来自维护</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22cuqix%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n_r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u893b2f0f" id="u893b2f0f">条分支而非单条残差流所增加的访存。在一个使用 400B token 训练的 25B-A3B MoE 模型上，这一改动使训练损失降低约 0.01。</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u26e772c8" id="u26e772c8" style="color: #5C0036">因此，仅拓宽残差流就能带来明显的损失下降。接下来需要确定的是，在拓宽后的残差流上增加多大程度的读写复杂度，才能在性能、效率与稳定性之间取得良好平衡</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u86e7684b" id="u86e7684b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3bcc92ca" id="u3bcc92ca">Hyper-Connections：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue017f892" id="ue017f892">读取算子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vGiWD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue7e64eec" id="ue7e64eec">构造块输入，写入算子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22RYe3n%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u356e2738" id="u356e2738">将块输出分配至各分支，混合算子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aqa8v%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucbb587fc" id="ucbb587fc">则在分支之间交换信息</span></p><p data-lake-id="u60b1c5e6" id="u60b1c5e6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22i7S6C%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%29%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%29%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B19%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u26f18d9b" id="u26f18d9b" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22bqG6N%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%29%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%29%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BNorm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%29%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B20%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3575df66" id="u3575df66" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22A71VA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%2B1%29%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%29%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5E%7B%28%5C%5Cell%29%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5E%7B%5C%5Ctop%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B21%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ueef54a0e"><li fid="u6c2ea60f" data-lake-id="u5b8c096b" id="u5b8c096b"><span data-lake-id="u0b531e9e" id="u0b531e9e">三个算子均根据残差状态预测。令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22idZqG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bnorm%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%5E%7B(%5C%5Cell)%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uefc8c3f2" id="uefc8c3f2">表示归一化后的分支状态，则每个算子均由静态项与数据依赖项相加得到</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8ac1b521" id="u8ac1b521" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22U36m9%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Clambda_m%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cphi%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_m%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B22%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udff973f6" id="udff973f6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22uWfAD%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Clambda_c%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cphi%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_c%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B23%7D%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uad8bfe35" id="uad8bfe35" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22l92Mr%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%5Cn%2B%5Cn%5C%5Clambda_r%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cphi%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_r%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B24%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u8ab51eed"><li fid="u2a6755c9" data-lake-id="uba1afe9a" id="uba1afe9a"><span data-lake-id="u399e8933" id="u399e8933">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22WBjXG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u42044022" id="u42044022">为可学习的静态项，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vKWKX%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u58df31e8" id="u58df31e8">用于投影归一化后的残差，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22NSpJa%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufcfc96ef" id="ufcfc96ef">为激活函数，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eQUqI%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucccc9f93" id="ucccc9f93">为可学习的缩放参数。HC 使用</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tHk66%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%3D%5C%5Ctanh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u57b88c67" id="u57b88c67">，并将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22iaM86%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud1991edb" id="ud1991edb">初始化为 0.01；mHC 使用 sigmoid，并进一步将</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22awWQu%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1780f7d1" id="u1780f7d1">约束在双随机矩阵流形上</span></li><li fid="u2a6755c9" data-lake-id="u478bf7c6" id="u478bf7c6"><span data-lake-id="u81f9ebce" id="u81f9ebce">具体而言，将静态项设置为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SgaKx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7Be%7D_%7B%5C%5Cell%5C%5Cbmod%20n_r%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc0251bab" id="uc0251bab">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22wVrON%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7B1%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7884a25c" id="u7884a25c">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rym6G%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%5E%7Bs%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathbf%7BI%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud5bafe05" id="ud5bafe05">。当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22vRpO0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%3D0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u66d801a7" id="u66d801a7">时，这一初始化使拓宽后的网络从与预归一化基线完全一致的状态开始训练；若始终令</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nWPlx%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clambda_%7B%5C%5Cstar%7D%3D0%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u0112adde" id="u0112adde">，算子则保持静态，拓宽后的残差流不引入额外计算，从而恢复为前述简化 AltUp 变体</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u653e6a80" id="u653e6a80"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95afbb60" id="u95afbb60">从静态算子出发，实验结果支持以下设计选择</span></strong></p><ul list="u9bd6ba0a"><li fid="u6303a4ad" data-lake-id="u531c7e72" id="u531c7e72"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3981c74c" id="u3981c74c">采用有界的正值门控：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf147c2d2" id="uf147c2d2">sigmoid 在损失与训练稳定性方面均优于 tanh，与 mHC 的结论一致，与 GDN 和注意力组件中的门控实验结果相符</span></li><li fid="u6303a4ad" data-lake-id="u2d7119c2" id="u2d7119c2"><strong><span data-lake-id="u54d82499" id="u54d82499">使读写权重依赖输入：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uacd8c84b" id="uacd8c84b">相较于预归一化基线，静态拓宽方案使损失降低 0.021、平均基准得分提高 1.58 分；进一步引入数据依赖的读写权重，仅使损失再降低 0.002，却带来额外 1.98 分的基准提升。仅依据损失，会低估动态读写的价值</span></li><li fid="u6303a4ad" data-lake-id="u1bb7d6c9" id="u1bb7d6c9"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua44b979d" id="ua44b979d" style="color: #5C0036">细化读取粒度，保留标量写入：将读取权重从每个分支一个标量细化为每个分支、每个通道一个权重能够带来收益；对写入权重进行同样的细化则几乎没有收益，因此写入仍采用每分支一个标量</span></strong></li><li fid="u6303a4ad" data-lake-id="u48534fa1" id="u48534fa1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3af9b351" id="u3af9b351">利用全部分支预测算子，并分别归一化：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u11ab78fe" id="u11ab78fe">使用全部分支优于仅使用最后一个分支或先对分支池化；对每个分支独立执行 RMSNorm，即对拓宽后的残差流采用分组 RMSNorm，还能进一步改善表现</span></li><li fid="u6303a4ad" data-lake-id="uccbe60a8" id="uccbe60a8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u703f723d" id="u703f723d">移除分支混合算子：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1c1a0b1c" id="u1c1a0b1c">当读取与写入具有足够的表达能力后，增加</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22KKaKy%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n_r%5C%5Ctimes%20n_r%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue072165e" id="ue072165e">的混合算子</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22t9Ylq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub8fedbe3" id="ub8fedbe3">不再带来显著收益</span></li></ul><figure data-lake-id="u5978b364" id="u5978b364" class="lake-figure" style="width:940.2000732421875px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A940.2000732421875%2C%22height%22%3A151.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1339%2C%22originHeight%22%3A215%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u13433412%22%7D" data-asset="assets/956b2d24c27e1e700326916396e89bce.png"></card></figure><p data-lake-id="u9388a4ee" id="u9388a4ee"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3baffdf" id="ua3baffdf" style="color: #AD1A2B">门控残差（Gated Residual，GR）：在 RMSNorm 之后加入轻量级的逐元素自门控，能够显著改善训练稳定性。将这一操作称为 GatedNorm</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue5ccf86d" id="ue5ccf86d" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jaTsE%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7BGatedNorm%7D%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D%29%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D%29%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Csigma%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_2%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_1%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%28%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bu%7D%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B25%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="uba22f1f6"><li fid="u5ae72d7b" data-lake-id="u1ce67382" id="u1ce67382"><span data-lake-id="u5f023259" id="u5f023259">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22upcpu%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_1%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u989cf9b1" id="u989cf9b1">和</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xWFcI%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u1a8407a0" id="u1a8407a0">构成一个低秩瓶颈。采用 sigmoid 门控、逐元素且依赖输入的读取，恰好对应于将式（25）应用于拓宽后的残差流。因此，将二者合并为一个算子，并将其称为门控残差。GR 首先对每个分支独立归一化</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u43955cb8" id="u43955cb8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22YH0Hz%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D_i%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BRMSNorm%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%3B%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cgamma%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%2C%5Cn%5C%5Cqquad%5Cni%3D1%2C%5C%5Cldots%2Cn_r%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B26%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue5c8be90"><li fid="u984e44c7" data-lake-id="u4ec32ebd" id="u4ec32ebd"><span data-lake-id="uc9a6063d" id="uc9a6063d">每个分支具有独立的缩放参数</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22DM7kC%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cboldsymbol%7B%5C%5Cgamma%7D_i%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bd%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua750bcc0" id="ua750bcc0">。根据全部分支，为每个分支的每个通道预测门控分数，并对门控后的分支取平均，得到块输入</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc4d3437c" id="uc4d3437c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22OD9Xs%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BG%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bunvec%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Csigma%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_u%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7BSiLU%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn_r%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_d%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bvec%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cin%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_r%5C%5Ctimes%20d%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn_r%7D%5Cn%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7Bn_r%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BG%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Codot%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D_i%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B27%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ue45c46f5"><li fid="u3fd3d007" data-lake-id="ucf5e174a" id="ucf5e174a"><span data-lake-id="ueb362ece" id="ueb362ece">其中，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22eOANo%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bvec%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uff8839bb" id="uff8839bb">将各分支拼接为长度为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22Vr3a4%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22n_rd%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u40c906d9" id="u40c906d9">的向量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22J5nYA%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bunvec%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubc2c2562" id="ubc2c2562">为其逆操作。投影矩阵满足</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22fOkS2%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_d%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Br%5C%5Ctimes%20n_rd%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u93b8f571" id="u93b8f571">、</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22i2thU%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_u%5C%5Cin%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_rd%5C%5Ctimes%20r%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u005d64c4" id="u005d64c4">，瓶颈秩设为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22ikBjw%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22r%3Dd%2F8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4b458114" id="u4b458114">。块输出</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22IVp4z%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%3D%5C%5Cmathcal%7BF%7D(%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bx%7D)%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2f34bc02" id="u2f34bc02">通过每个分支各自的数据依赖标量，写入所有分支</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf03bb7c6" id="uf03bb7c6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22SEBNP%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7Bs%7D%5Cn%3D%5Cn2%5C%5Csigma%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7Bn_r%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BW%7D_w%5Cn%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bvec%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cleft%28%5Cn%5C%5Cwidehat%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cright%29%5Cn%5C%5Cin%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbb%7BR%7D%5E%7Bn_r%7D%2C%5C%5Cqquad%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%27%5Cn%3D%5Cn%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D_i%2Bs_i%5C%5Cmathbf%7By%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B28%7D%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u04ca7260"><li fid="u02bc4fcf" data-lake-id="ua732f9b3" id="ua732f9b3"><span data-lake-id="ucb46992f" id="ucb46992f">激活函数为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22shOYi%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cphi%3D%5C%5Csigma%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7cb1549f" id="u7cb1549f">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CWmoR%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u25f76d78" id="u25f76d78">采用逐元素权重，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22zVfnv%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bcombine%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u36a1d9cd" id="u36a1d9cd">采用每分支一个标量，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22tVcBM%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coverline%7B%5C%5Cmathbf%7BR%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u53903802" id="u53903802">则对应对全部分支执行分组 RMSNorm 后的结果</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u669a9dda" id="u669a9dda"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf56c1fe8" id="uf56c1fe8" style="color: #AD1A2B">GR 相比动态 mHC 采用逐元素的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22oXKN0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bmix%7D%7D%22%7D" style="color: #AD1A2B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u5994d7df" id="u5994d7df" style="color: #AD1A2B">并移除</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22w5pmq%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%7D" style="color: #AD1A2B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ufd261595" id="ufd261595" style="color: #AD1A2B">；移除</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22CiRyy%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%7D" style="color: #AD1A2B"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u88d565af" id="u88d565af" style="color: #AD1A2B">后，每块少读取一次完整残差状态，降低访存开销</span></strong></p><ul list="u30ba047d"><li fid="u3146d7ee" data-lake-id="ua919d362" id="ua919d362"><span data-lake-id="u88937185" id="u88937185">其稳定性优势来自两个方面：GatedNorm 本身能够改善训练稳定性；同时，移除需要额外约束的</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22nurlg%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u39bc9abb" id="u39bc9abb">，也消除一个潜在的不稳定来源</span></li><li fid="u3146d7ee" data-lake-id="u97002ab7" id="u97002ab7"><span data-lake-id="u29287d9b" id="u29287d9b">GR、HC、mHC 与 VWN 属于同类方法，区别在于新增表达能力的分配。HC 和 mHC 将读取与写入保留为每分支标量，并通过</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22jvjmG%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubf492ccf" id="ubf492ccf">增强表达能力；mHC 进一步要求该矩阵满足双随机约束。VWN 也保留这些标量，并将拓宽的 token 嵌入分成较窄片段，实现更细粒度的读写</span></li><li fid="u3146d7ee" data-lake-id="u9a3c709a" id="u9a3c709a"><span data-lake-id="u6bb07bee" id="u6bb07bee">GR 则将表达能力主要用于读取，采用逐元素门控，并完全移除</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22gTL60%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbf%7BH%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bres%7D%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8352651a" id="u8352651a">。这一移除不会损害表现，同时避免每个块对整个残差状态的一次读取，而这正是拓宽残差流后推理开销的主要来源</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u43d25d1b" id="u43d25d1b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2ae3b659" id="u2ae3b659" style="color: #AD1A2B">消融实验表明，GR 能够同时改善损失与基准表现。利用 GR 不包含残差分支混合这一特点，将每个分支视为历史输出的累加器，从而精确分解每个块读取的内容中，来自各个先前块的贡献。实现上，在实际前向门控取值下，计算历史块经写入门控、RMS 归一化、通道缩放与逐元素读取门控后对当前块输入的向量贡献，再按范数归一化为占比，并减去无 GR 参考模型的对应占比，以刻画 GR 新增的跨层路径强度。分析表明，新增宽度主要用于若干特定路径：一个分支跨越多层保留早期注意力输出，其余三个分支主要承担局部信息传递</span></strong></p><ul list="uf0c9602f"><li fid="u54d8e8c3" data-lake-id="u29f0b7f2" id="u29f0b7f2"><span data-lake-id="uae591b87" id="uae591b87">长程分支主要在第 0 层接收写入，此后更新较少，因此早期信息能够持续被后续层访问。从 GR 分支中读取较多信息的子层主要是 softmax 注意力层，表明全局注意力承担整合显式长程历史上下文的重要作用</span></li><li fid="u54d8e8c3" data-lake-id="uf1e4d5fa" id="uf1e4d5fa"><span data-lake-id="u23fc295e" id="u23fc295e">总体上，GR 增强部分相邻层路径和长程路径，同时削弱中程路径。加权平均跨层跨度基本不变（3.97 与 3.91），变化主要体现在信息传递的分布上：少量特定路径获得更高的贡献权重</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="tTwVm" id="tTwVm"><span data-lake-id="u030174ca" id="u030174ca">⚓ 𝐍-𝐠𝐫𝐚𝐦 𝐄𝐦𝐛𝐞𝐝𝐝𝐢𝐧𝐠</span></h2><p data-lake-id="ub0762127" id="ub0762127"><strong><span data-lake-id="u54afa9c0" id="u54afa9c0">基于嵌入的记忆机制为模型容量扩展提供一个互补维度。N-gram 嵌入以局部上下文为条件进行记忆检索，而非仅依赖 token 标识，从而进一步推广单 token 查表机制。具体而言，以每个 token 结尾的短 n-gram 序列作为嵌入表的检索键，检索得到的向量用于增强相应的 token 表示</span></strong></p><ul list="uea6bc8a0"><li fid="u0ccccf2c" data-lake-id="ucb7d9f8c" id="ucb7d9f8c"><span data-lake-id="uddad2fc6" id="uddad2fc6">N-gram 记忆能够在每个 token 新增浮点运算量可忽略的情况下扩展容量，而确定性寻址则支持将嵌入表卸载至主机内存，并进行异步预取。采用多头哈希进行嵌入查表。随后，通过上下文门控机制将这些嵌入注入残差流</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ub483a362" id="ub483a362"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue3f3852e" id="ue3f3852e" style="color: #5C0036">一个嵌入层已经足够，最终放在第 2 层。实验没有发现某个深度始终最优，将相同参数预算分配到多个嵌入层也没有稳定收益。选择第 2 层，还可以让嵌入表预取与第 1 层计算重叠</span></strong></p><figure data-lake-id="u8e504416" id="u8e504416" class="lake-figure" style="width:886.0px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A886.0%2C%22height%22%3A221.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1326%2C%22originHeight%22%3A331%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub71d673a%22%7D" data-asset="assets/37e4dca2edb8b6784c6334f44fdfd153.png"></card></figure><p data-lake-id="ufff1be5a" id="ufff1be5a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9f6a35a2" id="u9f6a35a2" style="color: #00346B">N-gram 容量与 MoE 专家容量不能简单互换。固定总参数预算时，扩大嵌入表、同时减少专家数量，虽然可能降低损失，但没有带来明确的下游性能提升。因此，后续实验保持 MoE 参数预算不变，额外增加 N-gram 嵌入容量</span></strong></p><figure data-lake-id="u2e3a3047" id="u2e3a3047" class="lake-figure" style="width:910.0px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A910.0%2C%22height%22%3A126.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1334%2C%22originHeight%22%3A184%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u597135ea%22%7D" data-asset="assets/154b3b22a31eb35458342e0cfbc2bdce.png"></card></figure><p data-lake-id="u850635ca" id="u850635ca"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0b2a4b85" id="u0b2a4b85" style="color: #665800">扩大词表可降低损失，但下游能力未同步增长。将 N-gram 词表从基础词表的 20 倍扩大至 200 倍，损失持续下降，但部分下游基准逐渐饱和或出现波动；中文基准改善较为持续。token 规范化、不同 N-gram 阶数的非均匀分配、按频率划分槽位等优化，在该训练方案下也无稳定收益</span></strong></p><figure data-lake-id="u74ca457c" id="u74ca457c" class="lake-figure" style="width:881.0px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A881.0%2C%22height%22%3A155.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1341%2C%22originHeight%22%3A236%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22ue1816bc0%22%7D" data-asset="assets/ee788f0f36d639253f8352d68df51ae0.png"></card></figure><h2 data-lake-id="DJmNp" id="DJmNp"><span data-lake-id="u08ecd72f" id="u08ecd72f">📡</span><span data-lake-id="ua5ebd100" id="ua5ebd100" style="color: #DF2A3F"> </span><span data-lake-id="u43d777b0" id="u43d777b0">𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uffb1094c" id="uffb1094c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9a573eb5" id="u9a573eb5" style="color: #DF2A3F">Muon 的正交化配置。模型以 Muon 为主要优化器，通过 Newton–Schulz（NS）迭代对 Nesterov 动量进行正交化。动量系数设为 0.95，采用 Polar Express 的逐步迭代系数，并执行 8 次迭代。对于形状为</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22BbXl0%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22A%5C%5Ctimes%20B%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="udd0e6b05" id="udd0e6b05" style="color: #DF2A3F">的矩阵，正交化结果按</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22kDenL%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cgamma(A%2CB)%3D0.2%5C%5Csqrt%7B%5C%5Cmax(A%2CB)%7D%22%7D" style="color: #DF2A3F"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u9d65bd34" id="u9d65bd34" style="color: #DF2A3F">缩放。更充分的正交化能够降低梯度范数尖峰的频率与幅度</span></strong></p><ul list="ucfc0f814"><li fid="u7f25f652" data-lake-id="ud9662463" id="ud9662463"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7ccf742e" id="u7ccf742e">按参数功能选择优化器。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u67284d08" id="u67284d08">Muon 主要用于承担线性映射的二维权重，包括注意力和 GDN 的主要投影、MoE 专家的线性层，以及 N-gram 嵌入层的键值投影。输入嵌入、输出头、MoE 路由器及 GR 的两个低秩投影保留 AdamW；N-gram 嵌入表则使用关闭权重衰减的 Adam。路由器使用 Muon 会加剧训练早期波动，在中后期切换也未获得显著性能收益</span></li><li fid="u7f25f652" data-lake-id="ucf24eeeb" id="ucf24eeeb"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue36ea19f" id="ue36ea19f">融合参数必须按独立算子拆分。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf7744d67" id="uf7744d67">直接对融合矩阵进行正交化，会混合无关子块的奇异方向，并依据拼接后的形状计算更新缩放。因此，注意力 QKV 和 GDN 输入投影按头拆分，SwiGLU 的 fc1 按 gate 与 up 两部分拆分，分别执行正交化后再恢复原始布局。GDN 的衰减与 beta 投影在逐头拆分后为向量，不参与正交化。该处理使优化器更新与实际算子结构相匹配，并改善损失或下游表现</span></li><li fid="u7f25f652" data-lake-id="ue393e022" id="ue393e022"><strong><span data-lake-id="u768b5b76" id="u768b5b76">分布式实现围绕正交化成本调整。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua1e25068" id="ua1e25068">Canzona 按估计的 NS 浮点运算量在数据并行进程间分配完整矩阵，通过跨张量并行进程通信重建矩阵，保留与单设备 Muon 数学等价的更新及原有通信重叠。参数拆分产生大量小计算核，用 CUDA Graph 捕获整个优化器步骤可降低启动开销</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u7944e1a5" id="u7944e1a5"><strong><span data-lake-id="u46cce43a" id="u46cce43a" style="color: #DF2A3F">新架构与优化器使近最优配置向更大的批量大小和学习率移动。因此，重新拟合超参数缩放规律，而非直接沿用 Qwen3.5 的训练配置。新的拟合还预测，随着模型规模增加，最优学习率的下降速度更慢。批量大小与学习率的预测分别在不同训练条件下验证</span></strong></p><ul list="u8ac07f4a"><li fid="u644a5424" data-lake-id="u75a5ef8b" id="u75a5ef8b"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua5db19b4" id="ua5db19b4">小模型、长训练预算。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9d4c396b" id="u9d4c396b">在训练 4T token 的 10.8B-A0.89B 模型上，将每步批量从 12.6M token 调整至预测值 25.2M，并使用对应学习率，最终损失降低约</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22aBfoh%22%2C%22code%22%3A%227.2%5C%5Ctimes10%5E%7B-3%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub5263a78" id="ub5263a78">；进一步增至 37.7M，损失仅小幅变差</span></li><li fid="u644a5424" data-lake-id="u896b9e22" id="u896b9e22"><strong><span data-lake-id="u25ed12f2" id="u25ed12f2">大模型、有限训练预算。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue4260d5a" id="ue4260d5a">在训练 419B token 的 48 层 156B-A7B 模型上，新配置相较旧配置使最终损失降低约</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22rRuI7%22%2C%22code%22%3A%227.8%5C%5Ctimes10%5E%7B-3%7D%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua9404c8e" id="ua9404c8e">，并改善下游表现。预测值附近的多组配置表现接近，说明其位于较平坦的近最优区域</span></li><li fid="u644a5424" data-lake-id="u80e38b82" id="u80e38b82"><strong><span data-lake-id="ufbbfd1db" id="ufbbfd1db">在本文配置下，批量大小预热没有带来收益。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u50f2c14e" id="u50f2c14e"> 将批量逐步增加至目标值，并未优于从训练开始就采用目标批量；在相同 token 预算下，反而增加 18.8% 的优化器更新步数，也未改善稳定性。因此，正式训练不采用批量大小预热</span></li></ul><figure data-lake-id="u043887f6" id="u043887f6" class="lake-figure" style="width:725.2000732421875px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A725.2000732421875%2C%22height%22%3A336.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1314%2C%22originHeight%22%3A608%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub2489972%22%7D" data-asset="assets/4249a6d44cbb967f0d37ece6a03634ad.png"></card></figure><p data-lake-id="u95ac5d57" id="u95ac5d57"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc1b3f05e" id="uc1b3f05e" style="color: #DF2A3F">压力测试检验高学习率下的稳定裕度。论文在 28 层 MoE 上，将学习率固定为最优值的 2 倍或 4 倍，不使用常规衰减，并在相同批量大小和梯度裁剪阈值下比较不同配置。评价指标包括损失尖峰、裁剪前梯度范数及激活极值</span></strong></p><ul list="ufd7060cb"><li fid="uca092df7" data-lake-id="u48292605" id="u48292605"><span data-lake-id="ue17438fc" id="ue17438fc">在 4 倍最优学习率下，AdamW 基线每万步出现 183 次损失尖峰；两个 Muon 配置均未跨越梯度裁剪阈值，其中 Muon 与 GR 的组合未出现损失尖峰。结果表明，新架构与优化器组合在相同压力条件下具有更大的稳定裕度</span></li><li fid="uca092df7" data-lake-id="ub4c0923f" id="ub4c0923f"><strong><span data-lake-id="u832623cb" id="u832623cb">门控的稳定化作用得到单变量实验支持。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0ef886b1" id="u0ef886b1"> 在保持 AdamW、模型结构及其他条件一致的情况下，仅启用 GatedNorm，就使 3 倍最优学习率下的损失尖峰从每万步 32.0 次降至 3.2 次，梯度范数越过阈值的次数从 256 次降至 20 次。作者据此认为，乘性门控提供显式的重缩放机制，有助于抑制高学习率下的激活离群值与训练波动</span></li><li fid="uca092df7" data-lake-id="u14caf374" id="u14caf374"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0f70a191" id="u0f70a191">正式训练验证上述收益。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4d275db6" id="u4d275db6"> 在使用相同数据顺序、学习率调度与优化器的前三组 276B token 训练对比中，相较于 Qwen3.5 架构与 Muon 的组合，加入 GR 使损失降低 0.026，完整 Flash-Next 方案进一步降低 0.032，累计改善 0.058。门控配置同时降低梯度范数波动和残差激活极值，使模型在不依赖 qk-clip、SwiGLU-clip 等显式激活控制方法的情况下保持稳定训练</span></li></ul><figure data-lake-id="uec60a209" id="uec60a209" class="lake-figure" style="width:692.2000732421875px"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22width%22%3A692.2000732421875%2C%22height%22%3A319.0%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1319%2C%22originHeight%22%3A607%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22id%22%3A%22u43f5b7b2%22%7D" data-asset="assets/122ef7a130367ac81314544099564b8a.png"></card></figure>